@@ -6,6 +6,8 @@ description: "Desktop runs the Harness workspace in a native application. This r
 
 English | [中文](README.zh.md)
 
+Plugin management facts are retained under the application user-data `plugin-operations` directory in two bounded 256 KiB segments. Records carry Host run identity and whitelisted operation metadata, excluding raw install specifications and error output. After the independent basic crash report is saved, an isolated Worker may append at most 100 recent records within 64 KiB read/output budgets. Counters and a completion marker distinguish missing, truncated or cancelled collection; missing records never establish that no plugin changes occurred. Diagnostic collection does not authorize installation, delay management operations or upload reports.
+
 ## Summary
 
 Desktop runs the Harness workspace in a native application. This reference covers application behavior, development and integration; the packaging, Windows signing and publication guides own build and release operations.
